###  https://purl.archive.org/akco#errSystematic
:errSystematic rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                        :Error ;
               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> :errPVSemSemWrong ;
               rdfs:comment "A systematic error is an error that occurs during the knowledge creation process or was part of the original source. It is characterized by the same source and occurence."@en ;
               rdfs:label "errSystematic"@en .


###  https://purl.archive.org/akco#errTailVertical
